WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.800 --> 00:30.030
-Master. -Master.

3
00:31.280 --> 00:32.520
-Master. -Master.

4
00:32.750 --> 00:33.430
Master.

5
00:34.270 --> 00:34.800
Master.

6
00:35.360 --> 00:36.010
The Young Master...

7
00:36.010 --> 00:37.140
The Young Master...

8
00:41.000 --> 00:42.530
Master, be careful.

9
00:46.840 --> 00:48.200
What happened?

10
00:48.460 --> 00:49.540
Where is Yuanfan?

11
00:49.950 --> 00:50.700
Master,

12
00:50.720 --> 00:53.340
when I got here, the Young Master was already gone.

13
00:53.340 --> 00:55.450
All I found was the blood left on the bed.

14
00:55.450 --> 00:58.250
Get everyone in the Salt Gang to look for my son!

15
00:58.390 --> 00:59.320
Yes, Master.

16
00:59.450 --> 01:00.320
Wait!

17
01:01.120 --> 01:01.800
Master.

18
01:01.920 --> 01:03.750
Go find those sorcerers!

19
01:04.120 --> 01:05.840
If they dare to deceive me,

20
01:05.840 --> 01:08.000
I will skin them alive!

21
02:49.020 --> 02:52.710
[A Prophet]

22
02:53.520 --> 02:55.610
[Episode 21]

23
02:58.590 --> 02:59.310
Master.

24
02:59.590 --> 03:00.560
They are back.

25
03:01.030 --> 03:03.160
They said they prepared a gift for you.

26
03:04.710 --> 03:05.630
Come on in.

27
03:11.170 --> 03:11.900
Sect Master.

28
03:12.800 --> 03:13.530
Sect Master.

29
03:16.300 --> 03:17.230
What an eyesore.

30
03:18.150 --> 03:19.550
Send him to the woodshed.

31
03:38.630 --> 03:40.030
The weather is changing.

32
03:40.430 --> 03:41.890
I guess it's going to rain.

33
03:46.590 --> 03:48.000
In a few hours,

34
03:49.590 --> 03:51.850
the Salt Gang will come out in full force.

35
03:52.680 --> 03:54.210
There are hundreds of them,

36
03:54.590 --> 03:56.320
and every one of them can fight.

37
03:56.520 --> 03:57.680
Our Tianxiang Sect

38
03:57.910 --> 03:59.570
is probably doomed this time.

39
04:02.030 --> 04:04.630
Why didn't you just kill Shangguan Chengming?

40
04:04.750 --> 04:05.800
If you killed him,

41
04:06.280 --> 04:08.310
we could just end this.

42
04:11.870 --> 04:13.400
Cut the crap.

43
04:14.080 --> 04:16.810
It's all because someone tried to use me as a pawn.

44
04:18.430 --> 04:19.070
Really?

45
04:20.269 --> 04:21.070
Who?

46
04:22.060 --> 04:22.940
How did it go?

47
04:23.870 --> 04:25.190
I turned a killing trap

48
04:25.930 --> 04:27.390
into a money-making trap.

49
04:27.940 --> 04:29.210
I wonder if you like it.

50
04:29.360 --> 04:30.610
I like making money.

51
04:31.270 --> 04:32.200
Tell me about it.

52
04:32.240 --> 04:33.510
Given Zhang Yinhua's tuberculosis,

53
04:33.510 --> 04:35.240
he won't last more than a month.

54
04:35.280 --> 04:36.940
Even if we trap Li Ling's soul,

55
04:37.260 --> 04:38.920
when Zhang Yinhua ends up dead

56
04:39.360 --> 04:40.430
and word gets out,

57
04:40.640 --> 04:42.300
how can others still trust us?

58
04:43.000 --> 04:44.770
The double-sided trap can last for 50 years,

59
04:44.770 --> 04:46.430
all thanks to your foresight—

60
04:47.159 --> 04:48.760
we do soul-trapping rituals

61
04:48.830 --> 04:50.560
for whoever can make a fortune.

62
04:50.560 --> 04:51.510
Now,

63
04:51.530 --> 04:53.210
Zhang Yinhua is about to fall.

64
04:53.240 --> 04:55.360
You're only worried about

65
04:55.750 --> 04:57.680
how to keep this up after his death.

66
04:58.040 --> 04:58.990
Exactly.

67
04:59.430 --> 05:00.360
And then?

68
05:00.980 --> 05:03.760
Zhang Yuanfan will be the future head of the Zhang family.

69
05:03.760 --> 05:05.630
As long as he trusts us completely,

70
05:05.630 --> 05:07.120
this trap will not end

71
05:07.600 --> 05:08.830
for the next 50 years.

72
05:09.190 --> 05:10.560
Then what do you plan to do?

73
05:10.560 --> 05:12.360
I hope you can do me a small favor.

74
05:17.430 --> 05:18.760
Arrange a killing trap?

75
05:20.120 --> 05:20.920
No killing.

76
05:57.560 --> 05:58.190
Master.

77
06:01.830 --> 06:02.750
You're here.

78
06:04.830 --> 06:06.430
I was just pondering over it.

79
06:08.000 --> 06:09.680
I watched you grow up.

80
06:10.040 --> 06:12.830
Among the Batous in our sect,

81
06:13.390 --> 06:15.240
you're the quickest-witted.

82
06:15.680 --> 06:17.160
You can both figure out the bigger picture

83
06:17.160 --> 06:18.800
and get small things done efficiently.

84
06:18.800 --> 06:21.270
You've made me plenty of money

85
06:21.870 --> 06:24.950
and also caused me as much trouble.

86
06:27.480 --> 06:28.070
Master.

87
06:29.430 --> 06:30.390
I was wrong.

88
06:32.470 --> 06:33.800
What did you do wrong?

89
06:34.390 --> 06:36.120
I shouldn't have saved Li Ling.

90
06:37.000 --> 06:38.240
So you mean this.

91
06:42.920 --> 06:45.450
It seems that you've saved more than just her.

92
06:50.240 --> 06:50.970
Sect Master.

93
06:52.070 --> 06:53.630
Liu Xijiao and the others

94
06:54.070 --> 06:56.240
were all carefully trained by the sect for years.

95
06:56.240 --> 06:57.800
It would be such a pity for them to die in the trap.

96
06:57.800 --> 06:58.920
How about we let them flee first?

97
06:58.920 --> 06:59.950
And when our sect

98
06:59.950 --> 07:01.600
needs them,

99
07:01.600 --> 07:02.870
we can get them back to serve.

100
07:02.870 --> 07:04.390
Also, please rest assured,

101
07:04.390 --> 07:05.870
they have all sworn on their lives

102
07:05.870 --> 07:07.430
never to reveal a word about it.

103
07:07.430 --> 07:08.240
Look at you.

104
07:08.830 --> 07:09.830
Impressive.

105
07:10.510 --> 07:12.640
You're far-sighted and considerate.

106
07:13.120 --> 07:13.850
Sect Master,

107
07:14.720 --> 07:16.780
I am willing to accept my punishment.

108
07:20.070 --> 07:22.270
Let me show you something interesting.

109
07:28.750 --> 07:30.950
You gave this to Liu Xijiao, didn't you?

110
07:33.270 --> 07:35.470
Seems like she doesn't need it anymore.

111
08:06.140 --> 08:09.590
[Verdict from the Underworld]

112
08:45.960 --> 08:47.360
Are you a human or a ghost?

113
08:48.910 --> 08:50.080
Where am I?

114
08:50.360 --> 08:52.240
City God Temple,

115
08:52.610 --> 08:56.140
the first pass to the underworld.

116
08:56.230 --> 08:57.470
Stop fooling me!

117
08:57.560 --> 08:58.790
I was sleeping at home.

118
08:58.790 --> 08:59.790
Then I woke up and ended up here.

119
08:59.790 --> 09:00.790
How did I die?

120
09:00.790 --> 09:01.790
Tell me!

121
09:03.270 --> 09:04.600
Everyone...

122
09:06.020 --> 09:07.620
Says so.

123
09:18.720 --> 09:19.440
Master,

124
09:20.010 --> 09:22.540
I ran into a female ghost by chance yesterday.

125
09:22.670 --> 09:24.390
She was trapped in the mortal world

126
09:24.390 --> 09:26.040
and begged me to take her back.

127
09:26.040 --> 09:28.170
Not until I took her back to this family

128
09:28.270 --> 09:29.510
did I realize

129
09:29.630 --> 09:31.440
that her soul was trapped.

130
09:31.720 --> 09:33.910
I want to help the Zhang family handle this,

131
09:33.910 --> 09:35.320
but my power is not strong enough.

132
09:35.320 --> 09:36.790
Master, please help me.

133
09:38.670 --> 09:39.960
This matter of the Zhang family

134
09:39.960 --> 09:41.360
is not that simple.

135
09:41.440 --> 09:43.120
I need to think it through.

136
09:44.030 --> 09:46.670
Yuanfan...

137
09:47.550 --> 09:50.080
I suffered so much...

138
09:51.870 --> 09:53.790
Yuanfan.

139
09:55.200 --> 09:57.150
Yuanfan...

140
09:58.120 --> 09:59.510
You betrayed me.

141
10:01.000 --> 10:02.150
Open the door! Help!

142
10:02.150 --> 10:03.510
Yuanfan.

143
10:03.550 --> 10:04.150
Open the door! Help!

144
10:04.150 --> 10:05.550
You put me through this.

145
10:05.790 --> 10:07.120
Open the door!

146
10:07.320 --> 10:08.200
Help!

147
10:09.720 --> 10:11.030
Yuanfan...

148
10:11.030 --> 10:12.320
Don't come over!

149
10:12.480 --> 10:13.720
Open the door! Help!

150
10:14.440 --> 10:15.670
Master, open the door!

151
10:15.670 --> 10:17.150
Help! Help!

152
10:17.150 --> 10:18.150
Master!

153
10:29.750 --> 10:31.510
Master, save me.

154
10:31.510 --> 10:33.670
I am Zhang Yuanfan, the Young Master of the Zhang family

155
10:33.670 --> 10:34.630
you mentioned.

156
10:35.030 --> 10:36.480
Why are you here?

157
10:36.500 --> 10:37.950
I was sleeping at home.

158
10:37.980 --> 10:39.090
I woke up and ended up here!

159
10:39.090 --> 10:41.370
Yuanfan...

160
10:42.600 --> 10:44.080
You can see Li Ling?

161
10:45.390 --> 10:46.850
Isn't she right out there?

162
10:47.000 --> 10:48.800
Did you drink the talisman water

163
10:49.000 --> 10:50.400
I gave your Zhang family?

164
10:50.960 --> 10:52.630
I did drink it. I drank it all.

165
10:52.630 --> 10:54.550
Why did you still end up dead after drinking it?

166
10:54.550 --> 10:55.670
I don't know.

167
10:59.120 --> 11:00.580
Did you pee after drinking

168
11:00.660 --> 11:01.790
the talisman water?

169
11:08.150 --> 11:09.750
You can't pee that talisman water out!

170
11:09.750 --> 11:11.140
Peeing it out would lose its effect!

171
11:11.140 --> 11:11.940
Master,

172
11:12.570 --> 11:14.170
how could I hold my pee?

173
11:19.760 --> 11:22.080
You're already in the City God Temple now.

174
11:22.080 --> 11:23.960
This is the first pass to the underworld.

175
11:23.960 --> 11:25.080
Once the door opens,

176
11:25.080 --> 11:26.300
take your verdict,

177
11:26.320 --> 11:27.510
remove your living registration,

178
11:27.510 --> 11:28.910
have it stamped with the City God's seal,

179
11:28.910 --> 11:30.710
and you can go to the underworld.

180
11:32.550 --> 11:33.630
I'm really dead?

181
11:35.000 --> 11:36.600
Yuanfan...

182
11:37.750 --> 11:39.200
Master, Master,

183
11:39.440 --> 11:41.840
I beg you to take me back to the mortal world.

184
11:41.840 --> 11:42.790
As long as you take me back,

185
11:42.790 --> 11:43.910
my father will pay you

186
11:43.910 --> 11:44.960
as much as you want!

187
11:44.960 --> 11:46.480
My father never hesitates to spend money for me.

188
11:46.480 --> 11:47.870
I am also a filial son.

189
11:48.440 --> 11:49.600
I still need to take care of him.

190
11:49.600 --> 11:50.720
Master, I'm begging you.

191
11:50.720 --> 11:52.360
Even if I take you back,

192
11:52.360 --> 11:53.360
in a few days...

193
11:53.380 --> 11:55.310
Yuanfan...

194
11:56.160 --> 11:57.820
You will still come down here.

195
11:59.480 --> 12:01.140
Could it be that if I ascend to the mortal world,

196
12:01.140 --> 12:03.170
Li Ling can still chase me there to kill me?

197
12:03.170 --> 12:04.740
You killed Li Ling and trapped her soul

198
12:04.740 --> 12:06.520
soon after she married into your family.

199
12:06.520 --> 12:08.420
There's no way she won't cause you trouble.

200
12:08.420 --> 12:09.900
I had no other choice.

201
12:10.450 --> 12:12.180
Given my father's poor health,

202
12:12.200 --> 12:13.600
he couldn't hold on for much longer.

203
12:13.600 --> 12:14.510
I just talked

204
12:15.440 --> 12:17.390
to my master about this matter.

205
12:17.790 --> 12:19.030
If he is willing to lend a hand,

206
12:19.030 --> 12:20.000
it'll take him

207
12:20.000 --> 12:23.060
less than 7 days to annihilate this evil ghost, Li Ling.

208
12:23.840 --> 12:24.630
However,

209
12:27.310 --> 12:28.670
Li Ling may not be the one

210
12:31.510 --> 12:33.240
trying to harm you, I'm afraid.

211
12:33.960 --> 12:35.360
Then who else could it be?

212
12:35.940 --> 12:38.260
This person is very close to you.

213
12:42.240 --> 12:43.120
Xiaomei?

214
12:44.750 --> 12:45.630
Dingxiang?

215
12:46.440 --> 12:47.360
Fengxia?

216
12:47.360 --> 12:48.200
Zhen?

217
12:48.480 --> 12:49.630
It's your father,

218
12:50.650 --> 12:51.770
Zhang Yinhua.

219
12:53.400 --> 12:55.400
He wanted to trap Li Ling's soul to prolong his lifespan

220
12:55.400 --> 12:56.240
but failed.

221
12:56.410 --> 12:58.400
Even if he takes in another concubine now

222
12:58.400 --> 12:59.530
and treats her well,

223
12:59.790 --> 13:01.000
his health

224
13:01.020 --> 13:02.910
probably won't hold out until then.

225
13:02.910 --> 13:03.960
Therefore,

226
13:04.030 --> 13:06.960
he wants to trap someone who is closest to him

227
13:07.410 --> 13:09.320
and will never betray him.

228
13:10.630 --> 13:12.270
I am his son.

229
13:14.010 --> 13:16.440
Our Zhang family has had only one heir for 3 generations respectively.

230
13:16.440 --> 13:18.240
Would he end his own bloodline?

231
13:18.270 --> 13:19.240
Disciple,

232
13:19.910 --> 13:21.750
we are both cultivators.

233
13:22.200 --> 13:24.720
Do not interfere with other people's karma.

234
13:25.240 --> 13:27.510
Just send him back to the mortal world.

235
13:27.650 --> 13:29.590
Whether it's a blessing or retribution

236
13:29.590 --> 13:30.880
depends on his fate.

237
13:32.760 --> 13:33.950
Thank you, Master!

238
13:34.050 --> 13:35.250
Thank you, Master!

239
13:37.590 --> 13:38.400
Go!

240
13:54.530 --> 13:56.200
Li Ling isn't the only one

241
13:56.230 --> 13:58.360
trapped in your Zhang family's place.

242
13:58.450 --> 14:00.180
Do you know these people?

243
14:06.600 --> 14:07.480
Stepmother?

244
14:10.270 --> 14:11.400
Second Stepmother?

245
14:11.870 --> 14:13.000
And Concubine Liu?

246
14:16.630 --> 14:18.780
They can neither return to the mortal world

247
14:18.780 --> 14:20.380
nor go to the underworld now.

248
14:20.880 --> 14:23.640
They can only wander around here.

249
14:25.670 --> 14:26.910
Will they hurt me then?

250
14:26.910 --> 14:27.480
Xijiao?

251
14:27.480 --> 14:28.340
Yes, of course.

252
14:29.030 --> 14:30.830
They died for your Zhang family.

253
14:31.270 --> 14:32.360
If you break into the trap,

254
14:32.360 --> 14:33.480
we will kill you!

255
14:34.480 --> 14:34.870
Go!

256
14:34.950 --> 14:36.160
Why harm me?

257
14:36.180 --> 14:37.760
My father trapped their souls, not me!

258
14:37.760 --> 14:38.890
That's why they say,

259
14:38.900 --> 14:40.530
"A son pays his father's debts."

260
14:40.530 --> 14:41.980
Isn't trapping souls meant to protect our family?

261
14:41.980 --> 14:43.300
It protects your father.

262
14:43.300 --> 14:45.520
Otherwise, he would have died 20 years ago.

263
14:45.520 --> 14:47.330
He's got all the boons,

264
14:47.360 --> 14:48.670
while the banes

265
14:48.690 --> 14:50.050
are coming to you, of course.

266
14:50.050 --> 14:51.000
No way, Master.

267
14:51.510 --> 14:52.270
I beg you.

268
14:52.320 --> 14:53.080
Please save me, Master.

269
14:53.080 --> 14:54.010
I'm begging you!

270
15:08.760 --> 15:10.760
Annihilate their souls,

271
15:13.060 --> 15:15.190
and you can return to the mortal world.

272
15:26.840 --> 15:27.510
Yuanfan.

273
15:29.000 --> 15:29.670
Yuanfan.

274
15:31.240 --> 15:32.470
I am Concubine Liu,

275
15:33.240 --> 15:34.200
Xijiao,

276
15:35.250 --> 15:36.480
Liu Xijiao!

277
15:41.000 --> 15:42.000
Concubine Liu...

278
15:42.910 --> 15:43.960
I remember you.

279
15:44.600 --> 15:45.260
Yuanfan...

280
15:45.320 --> 15:46.320
Don't come closer.

281
15:46.320 --> 15:47.580
Don't come any closer.

282
15:47.750 --> 15:48.550
Stay back.

283
15:50.720 --> 15:51.380
Yuanfan...

284
15:52.670 --> 15:53.150
Wait.

285
15:54.930 --> 15:55.690
Disciple,

286
15:56.270 --> 15:57.270
let him go.

287
16:02.510 --> 16:05.310
If my father could use you to prolong his lifespan,

288
16:06.130 --> 16:07.560
why can't I?

289
16:10.510 --> 16:11.480
I want to live.

290
16:11.670 --> 16:12.670
I want to survive!

291
16:12.960 --> 16:14.510
A son pays his father's debts.

292
16:14.510 --> 16:16.320
He's got all the boons,

293
16:16.320 --> 16:17.150
while the banes...

294
16:17.150 --> 16:17.550
Yuanfan...

295
16:17.550 --> 16:19.150
Are coming to you, of course.

296
16:19.240 --> 16:19.840
Go to hell.

297
16:20.720 --> 16:22.200
All of you, go to hell!

298
16:24.240 --> 16:24.840
No!

299
16:25.200 --> 16:25.790
No!

300
16:49.890 --> 16:51.040
These three people

301
16:52.240 --> 16:53.790
are my gift in return to you.

302
16:54.640 --> 16:56.920
Jiang Feiyan let these female Abaos go.

303
16:57.270 --> 16:58.790
You know the sect rules.

304
16:59.080 --> 17:00.840
I've been merciful enough.

305
17:01.000 --> 17:03.330
I had Chief Batou drug them.

306
17:03.360 --> 17:04.970
Although they've become deranged,

307
17:04.970 --> 17:06.930
they can still live for a while.

308
17:06.960 --> 17:09.369
If they weren't of use to your trap,

309
17:09.920 --> 17:11.250
they'd already be dead.

310
17:11.550 --> 17:12.960
They are not pawns!

311
17:13.030 --> 17:13.920
They are human!

312
17:14.589 --> 17:16.440
Do you care so little about human lives?

313
17:16.440 --> 17:18.450
Shout a bit louder, and he will wake up,

314
17:18.450 --> 17:19.990
and she would have died for nothing.

315
17:19.990 --> 17:21.450
Trampling on human lives—

316
17:22.869 --> 17:25.640
is this what the Tianxiang Sect calls "upholding justice"?

317
17:25.640 --> 17:27.240
"Upholding justice."

318
17:28.109 --> 17:29.700
Let me tell you what justice is.

319
17:29.700 --> 17:31.030
Whoever holds the power

320
17:31.110 --> 17:32.110
is justice.

321
17:32.310 --> 17:35.160
Whether I talk sense or nonsense,

322
17:35.880 --> 17:38.140
as long as people like him all believe it,

323
17:38.350 --> 17:39.750
that is justice.

324
17:40.240 --> 17:41.440
I know you can't kill anyone.

325
17:41.440 --> 17:42.790
You can't do it.

326
17:43.030 --> 17:44.640
But you must pass this test,

327
17:44.750 --> 17:46.480
so I had to give you a push.

328
17:47.030 --> 17:49.030
Didn't we agree not to kill?

329
17:51.790 --> 17:52.920
Making money

330
17:54.350 --> 17:55.720
is a bloody business.

331
18:08.960 --> 18:10.020
When did Liu Xijiao

332
18:10.830 --> 18:12.000
come back?

333
18:12.030 --> 18:13.550
This person has nothing to do with you anymore.

334
18:13.550 --> 18:14.760
Don't ask about her again.

335
18:14.760 --> 18:16.360
According to the sect rules,

336
18:16.570 --> 18:19.000
anyone who wants to leave must take 3 cuts and 6 stabs.

337
18:19.000 --> 18:20.270
Today, in front of the Sect Master,

338
18:20.270 --> 18:21.260
how could they still...

339
18:21.260 --> 18:23.120
Our Sect Master is soft-hearted.

340
18:24.750 --> 18:26.720
He gave the girls a chance

341
18:27.590 --> 18:29.350
to come back and help set a trap.

342
18:31.400 --> 18:32.200
That's right.

343
18:32.960 --> 18:33.640
Yes.

344
18:34.240 --> 18:35.270
After this trap is done,

345
18:35.270 --> 18:36.750
they will be allowed to leave.

346
18:36.750 --> 18:37.670
Listen,

347
18:37.700 --> 18:38.750
this girl will no longer

348
18:38.750 --> 18:40.470
be a member of our sect.

349
18:40.500 --> 18:42.930
You and she were just not meant to be together in this life,

350
18:42.930 --> 18:43.720
got it?

351
18:52.270 --> 18:53.240
Let's go.

352
19:01.880 --> 19:02.940
Glad that she left.

353
19:04.270 --> 19:05.470
Good to know she left.

354
19:33.030 --> 19:34.160
Knock as you please.

355
19:34.550 --> 19:35.480
This one is

356
19:35.830 --> 19:37.630
made of genuine nanmu wood,

357
19:37.960 --> 19:39.290
with a 9-inches-thick base

358
19:39.290 --> 19:40.490
and flawless planks.

359
19:41.840 --> 19:44.670
It can withstand any amount of knocking.

360
19:44.970 --> 19:45.770
I knew

361
19:45.800 --> 19:47.720
you would definitely show mercy

362
19:47.740 --> 19:49.460
and come buy a coffin for that girl.

363
19:49.460 --> 19:50.020
See?

364
19:50.270 --> 19:51.670
I specifically kept the best one

365
19:51.670 --> 19:52.430
just for you.

366
19:52.680 --> 19:53.740
It won't cost much.

367
19:54.790 --> 19:55.920
Just 3 gold bars.

368
19:55.960 --> 19:57.240
I'll take this coffin.

369
19:57.880 --> 19:59.000
I'll pay you

370
19:59.300 --> 20:00.700
when the trap is done.

371
20:01.720 --> 20:02.510
You really thought

372
20:02.510 --> 20:04.640
those female Abaos could escape?

373
20:04.640 --> 20:05.750
You know what?

374
20:05.960 --> 20:07.960
The Sect Master has been watching you all along.

375
20:07.960 --> 20:09.790
The Sect Master has already

376
20:09.960 --> 20:12.000
seen through your thoughts.

377
20:13.350 --> 20:14.720
I just don't get it.

378
20:15.750 --> 20:17.640
If you want to do good deeds,

379
20:18.160 --> 20:20.480
you can go be a teacher and join a revolution.

380
20:20.480 --> 20:21.110
Or at least,

381
20:21.110 --> 20:22.590
you can go become a monk in the mountains.

382
20:22.590 --> 20:24.590
Why did you join our Tianxiang Sect?

383
20:26.160 --> 20:27.890
I just feel sorry for that girl.

384
20:28.880 --> 20:30.210
What's wrong with that?

385
20:33.070 --> 20:34.200
Feel sorry for her?

386
20:36.070 --> 20:37.270
In these times,

387
20:37.880 --> 20:39.750
the world is awash with pitiful people.

388
20:39.750 --> 20:41.480
For us swindlers,

389
20:41.790 --> 20:42.750
if we can

390
20:42.920 --> 20:45.240
end up lying in a coffin like this,

391
20:45.830 --> 20:47.830
that will be the greatest blessing.

392
21:22.110 --> 21:23.720
How bold you are.

393
21:23.870 --> 21:25.200
How dare you come again?

394
21:25.590 --> 21:26.590
Where is my son?

395
21:26.750 --> 21:27.590
I've brought

396
21:28.130 --> 21:29.890
your son back to you.

397
21:33.960 --> 21:34.750
Yuanfan.

398
21:36.510 --> 21:37.350
Yuanfan!

399
21:37.350 --> 21:39.640
Don't worry, he's fine.

400
21:45.480 --> 21:47.590
Be careful.

401
21:48.030 --> 21:49.200
Young Master.

402
21:49.720 --> 21:50.480
Yuanfan.

403
21:51.400 --> 21:51.800
My boy.

404
21:52.200 --> 21:52.720
My boy?

405
21:55.640 --> 21:56.240
Li Ling...

406
21:57.590 --> 21:58.750
Li Ling...

407
21:58.750 --> 22:00.510
Li Ling wants to kill me...

408
22:02.510 --> 22:03.510
Don't let her come near.

409
22:03.510 --> 22:05.110
Don't let her come any closer!

410
22:05.110 --> 22:06.240
Keep her away from me.

411
22:06.240 --> 22:08.330
Your son just came back from the underworld.

412
22:08.330 --> 22:11.090
His soul fragments haven't fully returned yet.

413
22:12.260 --> 22:12.980
Yuanfan.

414
22:13.000 --> 22:13.930
Don't be afraid.

415
22:14.110 --> 22:15.110
I am here with you.

416
22:15.160 --> 22:15.790
Tell me

417
22:16.000 --> 22:16.960
what happened.

418
22:19.680 --> 22:20.270
Master!

419
22:20.590 --> 22:21.480
Master!

420
22:22.310 --> 22:23.070
Master!

421
22:23.440 --> 22:24.160
Master, I beg you.

422
22:24.160 --> 22:25.560
You must save me, Master!

423
22:25.790 --> 22:27.270
I don't want to go back there again!

424
22:27.270 --> 22:28.270
Master...

425
22:28.400 --> 22:30.920
You may take your son back to his room to rest first.

426
22:30.920 --> 22:32.400
Master, I'm scared...

427
22:32.510 --> 22:33.110
Master...

428
22:33.240 --> 22:33.960
Young Master.

429
22:33.960 --> 22:35.440
Please get up, Young Master.

430
22:35.440 --> 22:36.440
You're back home.

431
22:36.790 --> 22:37.350
Save me.

432
22:37.440 --> 22:38.400
Save me, Master.

433
22:39.070 --> 22:39.880
Master!

434
22:47.000 --> 22:47.880
Sir,

435
22:49.640 --> 22:51.790
you have done a great favor for our Zhang family.

436
22:51.790 --> 22:53.890
This is a gift to show our appreciation.

437
22:53.890 --> 22:54.780
Sir,

438
22:55.720 --> 22:57.510
I must say something in the first place.

439
22:57.510 --> 22:58.510
This matter

440
22:58.960 --> 22:59.820
is not over yet.

441
23:00.110 --> 23:01.440
Li Ling's soul

442
23:01.680 --> 23:03.570
is only temporarily suppressed by me.

443
23:03.570 --> 23:06.070
It will take one week to completely annihilate it.

444
23:06.070 --> 23:08.830
Be careful. Li Ling will come again this week.

445
23:13.770 --> 23:15.160
She will come again?

446
23:15.180 --> 23:16.710
She will not only come again

447
23:16.840 --> 23:19.020
but also take advantage of your son's weak condition

448
23:19.020 --> 23:20.470
to occupy his body.

449
23:20.490 --> 23:22.890
Therefore, you must not mention the matter of Li Ling

450
23:22.890 --> 23:24.490
and the soul trapping again.

451
23:24.880 --> 23:25.880
If you bring it up,

452
23:26.150 --> 23:28.150
you'll be summoning Li Ling's soul.

453
23:28.270 --> 23:29.790
Before possessing your son's body,

454
23:29.790 --> 23:31.640
Li Ling will bind him with evil energy,

455
23:31.640 --> 23:33.310
leaving scratch marks on his body.

456
23:33.310 --> 23:36.270
When that happens, you must keep your son's soul

457
23:36.320 --> 23:38.470
and not give Li Ling any opportunity.

458
23:42.240 --> 23:42.640
Tie him up!

459
23:42.640 --> 23:43.610
What are you doing?

460
23:43.610 --> 23:45.130
What? What are you doing?

461
23:45.430 --> 23:46.320
Let me go!

462
23:46.480 --> 23:48.590
You'll kill yourself scratching like that!

463
23:48.590 --> 23:50.790
I'm itchy, so I scratch! What's wrong with that?

464
23:50.790 --> 23:52.680
Father, tell them to let me go!

465
23:53.030 --> 23:54.130
I'm itchier when you tie me,

466
23:54.130 --> 23:54.960
Father!

467
23:55.030 --> 23:55.680
Hurry up!

468
23:55.680 --> 23:56.510
I won't scratch anymore.

469
23:56.510 --> 23:58.000
Just tell them to let me go,

470
23:58.000 --> 23:58.880
Father!

471
24:00.000 --> 24:01.160
Let me go!

472
24:06.110 --> 24:06.640
Master.

473
24:06.960 --> 24:07.590
Master.

474
24:09.350 --> 24:11.030
How is he doing now?

475
24:11.130 --> 24:12.520
As you ordered,

476
24:12.630 --> 24:14.290
we fed him the talisman water,

477
24:14.510 --> 24:15.840
and he's been sleeping.

478
24:16.000 --> 24:18.920
The Young Master's got ghost scratch marks all over his body,

479
24:18.920 --> 24:19.920
even on his back

480
24:19.920 --> 24:22.240
where he can't reach himself!

481
24:22.390 --> 24:23.780
It must be

482
24:24.550 --> 24:26.310
Li Ling coming for him.

483
24:28.490 --> 24:29.620
Have a seat, Master.

484
24:32.080 --> 24:33.720
I've been taking a turn

485
24:33.750 --> 24:35.550
for the worse day by day.

486
24:36.750 --> 24:38.990
Where is the girl I asked you to find?

487
24:39.440 --> 24:40.510
I'm still working on it.

488
24:40.510 --> 24:42.040
Why is it so hard to find one?

489
24:42.400 --> 24:44.590
With my wealth, I can't even find a wife?

490
24:44.590 --> 24:45.110
Go

491
24:45.480 --> 24:47.880
buy one from those poor people who are selling

492
24:47.880 --> 24:48.880
their daughters.

493
24:48.960 --> 24:49.690
Understood.

494
25:20.880 --> 25:21.720
Who is it?

495
25:50.670 --> 25:51.320
Who?

496
26:41.440 --> 26:42.370
Don't come over!

497
26:42.920 --> 26:44.180
Don't come any closer!

498
26:45.720 --> 26:46.440
Stay back!

499
26:47.030 --> 26:47.920
Back!

500
26:48.640 --> 26:49.640
I have money!

501
26:49.640 --> 26:51.000
I can give you everything!

502
26:51.000 --> 26:51.830
What are you all doing?

503
26:51.830 --> 26:52.310
Make way!

504
26:52.310 --> 26:53.570
Don't come any closer!

505
26:53.890 --> 26:55.090
-Master. -Master.

506
26:55.200 --> 26:56.130
Don't come over!

507
26:56.680 --> 26:57.590
Stay back!

508
26:59.150 --> 26:59.980
I have money!

509
27:00.000 --> 27:01.800
I can give you everything I have!

510
27:02.070 --> 27:02.640
Please spare me!

511
27:02.640 --> 27:03.240
Open the door.

512
27:03.240 --> 27:04.170
Don't come over!

513
27:13.160 --> 27:13.750
Yuanfan.

514
27:16.090 --> 27:16.730
Yuanfan!

515
27:39.310 --> 27:40.110
Li Ling...

516
27:41.720 --> 27:42.980
Li Ling has come for me.

517
27:47.200 --> 27:52.180
[Zhang Residence]

518
27:57.440 --> 27:57.960
What?

519
27:58.160 --> 27:59.290
Does it disgust you?

520
27:59.590 --> 28:00.680
You asked me to use eel blood,

521
28:00.680 --> 28:02.160
and now I stink of it.

522
28:03.270 --> 28:04.930
Eel blood is the most pungent.

523
28:05.070 --> 28:06.740
Only by attracting bats to hit the door this way

524
28:06.740 --> 28:09.200
could we make it sound like a ghost knocking.

525
28:11.900 --> 28:13.500
Guess who I saw the other day?

526
28:15.200 --> 28:15.640
Who?

527
28:16.880 --> 28:17.640
Liu Xijiao!

528
28:19.350 --> 28:20.160
Sect Master

529
28:20.160 --> 28:21.640
didn't stoop to their level.

530
28:21.640 --> 28:23.040
He had them help set a trap

531
28:23.400 --> 28:24.720
and then let them go.

532
28:26.240 --> 28:27.920
Sect Master is such a nice person,

533
28:27.920 --> 28:29.120
like a living Buddha.

534
28:46.550 --> 28:47.750
Young Master...

535
28:55.710 --> 28:56.510
I have already

536
28:56.750 --> 28:58.240
chosen the person.

537
28:58.670 --> 28:59.840
In a few days,

538
29:00.350 --> 29:01.200
you

539
29:01.310 --> 29:03.680
can perform the soul-trapping ritual.

540
29:04.790 --> 29:05.750
I've been watching

541
29:05.750 --> 29:07.210
this child for a long time.

542
29:07.240 --> 29:09.350
The child and the father live together

543
29:09.350 --> 29:10.200
in poverty.

544
29:10.720 --> 29:12.980
As long as I pay the family a little money,

545
29:13.400 --> 29:14.880
the child will definitely follow me...

546
29:14.880 --> 29:16.680
I think we should just forget it.

547
29:16.980 --> 29:18.870
It's a very filial child,

548
29:18.890 --> 29:19.920
young

549
29:19.950 --> 29:21.540
and promising.

550
29:22.610 --> 29:24.280
Are you really going to trap this child's soul?

551
29:24.280 --> 29:26.010
The child's mother died early.

552
29:26.710 --> 29:29.490
What's wrong with the child doing something for the father?

553
29:29.490 --> 29:31.750
It's a perfect choice for soul trapping.

554
29:34.490 --> 29:35.640
Close the door.

555
29:42.050 --> 29:44.790
Li Ling may not be the one trying to harm you, I'm afraid.

556
29:44.790 --> 29:46.000
Then who else could it be?

557
29:46.000 --> 29:47.960
It's your father, Zhang Yinhua.

558
29:48.340 --> 29:51.020
He can only trap someone who is closest to him

559
29:51.590 --> 29:53.350
and will never betray him.

560
30:03.920 --> 30:05.180
It protects your father.

561
30:05.180 --> 30:07.480
Otherwise, he would have died 20 years ago.

562
30:07.480 --> 30:09.240
He's got all the boons,

563
30:09.260 --> 30:10.120
while the banes

564
30:10.590 --> 30:12.190
are coming to you, of course.

565
30:42.790 --> 30:44.720
Where's the handprint on the door?

566
30:44.830 --> 30:46.440
Where's the handprint on the door?

567
30:46.440 --> 30:47.750
What handprint?

568
30:47.940 --> 30:49.580
Li Ling came last night.

569
30:51.200 --> 30:52.480
The handprint she left

570
30:53.110 --> 30:54.240
is gone!

571
30:54.480 --> 30:55.510
It's gone!

572
31:00.920 --> 31:01.680
Yuanfan.

573
31:04.070 --> 31:05.070
Look at me.

574
31:08.760 --> 31:10.280
Do you love me?

575
31:17.640 --> 31:18.510
My boy, tell me,

576
31:20.200 --> 31:21.350
do you love me?

577
31:21.460 --> 31:22.780
Then tell me,

578
31:25.110 --> 31:26.770
what's that water vat outside

579
31:27.330 --> 31:28.770
for?

580
31:32.170 --> 31:33.620
Isn't that used

581
31:34.040 --> 31:37.000
to make your favorite pickles?

582
31:37.680 --> 31:38.570
No!

583
31:39.640 --> 31:40.440
No...

584
31:40.720 --> 31:42.440
You use it to trap souls.

585
31:42.830 --> 31:43.590
Trap souls.

586
31:43.680 --> 31:44.640
Son,

587
31:45.060 --> 31:46.830
I don't know what you're talking about.

588
31:46.830 --> 31:47.980
Trap what?

589
31:48.110 --> 31:51.020
I don't get what you mean.

590
31:53.550 --> 31:55.080
Do you still remember this?

591
31:55.720 --> 31:57.460
When you trapped Li Ling's soul,

592
31:57.460 --> 31:58.390
her body...

593
31:58.730 --> 32:00.450
her body was covered

594
32:00.830 --> 32:02.480
with these marks scratched by ghosts.

595
32:02.480 --> 32:03.550
What did you say?

596
32:04.880 --> 32:05.750
Who?

597
32:06.020 --> 32:07.070
My wife...

598
32:07.090 --> 32:08.650
My wife, Li Ling!

599
32:08.680 --> 32:10.010
Didn't you trap her soul

600
32:10.200 --> 32:11.460
to prolong your lifespan?

601
32:11.460 --> 32:13.990
I don't know the person you're talking about.

602
32:18.880 --> 32:20.350
You're not going to live much longer.

603
32:20.350 --> 32:21.550
You need to find someone.

604
32:21.550 --> 32:23.080
You can't find anyone else,

605
32:23.310 --> 32:24.970
so you want to seal my soul now.

606
32:25.320 --> 32:27.050
You want to trap my soul, right?

607
32:29.000 --> 32:31.060
What nonsense are you talking about?

608
32:31.830 --> 32:32.470
Yuanfan,

609
32:33.270 --> 32:34.720
I love you!

610
32:35.590 --> 32:37.590
Do you love me?

611
32:37.960 --> 32:39.760
You've never asked if I love you.

612
32:41.720 --> 32:42.950
Why the sudden question?

613
32:42.950 --> 32:44.360
Why are you asking me all of a sudden now?

614
32:44.360 --> 32:46.430
I just want you to say it!

615
32:46.550 --> 32:47.600
Do you love me?

616
32:48.070 --> 32:49.550
Do you love me?

617
32:49.640 --> 32:51.440
Do you love me?

618
32:53.510 --> 32:54.240
I love you...

619
32:55.510 --> 32:57.030
I love you to death!

620
33:01.000 --> 33:02.370
You must keep your son's soul

621
33:02.370 --> 33:04.300
before Li Ling possesses his body.

622
33:04.470 --> 33:06.270
When you are alone with your son,

623
33:06.400 --> 33:07.030
ask him

624
33:07.720 --> 33:08.580
if he loves you.

625
33:09.000 --> 33:11.130
You must stare him straight in the eyes

626
33:11.270 --> 33:13.470
and make sure he answers this question.

627
33:17.430 --> 33:19.400
[Yunhe Temple]

628
33:22.880 --> 33:23.550
Master.

629
33:24.200 --> 33:25.000
Sir,

630
33:26.660 --> 33:28.070
why are you doing this?

631
33:28.120 --> 33:28.950
I want to...

632
33:33.070 --> 33:34.800
I want to trap my father's soul!

633
33:40.720 --> 33:41.480
Did I hear you wrong,

634
33:41.480 --> 33:42.940
or are you out of your mind?

635
33:43.830 --> 33:45.830
You want to trap your father's soul?

636
33:47.200 --> 33:50.460
That old man is already in the late stages of tuberculosis.

637
33:51.200 --> 33:53.730
Yet he wants to use me to prolong his lifespan.

638
33:54.590 --> 33:55.990
I know he's turned to you.

639
33:56.030 --> 33:57.960
You must have received a lot of rewards from him.

640
33:57.960 --> 33:59.110
But it doesn't matter!

641
33:59.110 --> 34:00.310
Whatever he pays you,

642
34:00.720 --> 34:01.960
I'll double it.

643
34:02.790 --> 34:03.480
Good?

644
34:03.930 --> 34:05.200
He is your father.

645
34:06.680 --> 34:07.600
Are you sure about this?

646
34:07.600 --> 34:10.070
There's no father in the world who doesn't care about his son.

647
34:10.070 --> 34:11.280
Is he even human?

648
34:12.400 --> 34:14.230
He always says my mother died early,

649
34:14.230 --> 34:16.030
and it wasn't easy for him to raise me alone.

650
34:16.030 --> 34:18.489
That's because he trapped my mother's soul.

651
34:18.550 --> 34:19.440
Therefore,

652
34:19.920 --> 34:20.880
trapping him

653
34:21.280 --> 34:22.719
is me upholding justice!

654
34:23.360 --> 34:25.159
I'll give you 3 more opium shops.

655
34:25.630 --> 34:26.830
Let's do it together.

656
34:27.320 --> 34:29.120
Let's uphold justice together.

657
34:32.110 --> 34:33.570
"Disasters and blessings

658
34:33.670 --> 34:35.000
are brought by humans."

659
34:35.150 --> 34:36.409
You must think through

660
34:38.960 --> 34:40.500
the consequences of this.

661
34:46.330 --> 34:47.790
I have thought it through.

662
34:50.280 --> 34:51.510
I'll kill him

663
34:53.230 --> 34:55.090
and get my hands covered in blood.

664
34:56.150 --> 34:57.030
And I'm leaving

665
34:59.030 --> 35:00.360
the rest to you, Master.

666
35:03.840 --> 35:04.590
Master!

667
35:06.960 --> 35:07.890
Young Master...

668
35:07.920 --> 35:08.670
The cellar!

669
35:11.260 --> 35:12.480
Stop that brat now!

670
35:13.490 --> 35:14.740
Be careful, Master.

671
35:21.150 --> 35:21.920
Master.

672
35:22.590 --> 35:23.050
Master.

673
35:29.230 --> 35:30.000
Yuanfan.

674
35:31.370 --> 35:32.080
My boy?

675
35:32.880 --> 35:33.550
Yuanfan!

676
36:01.440 --> 36:02.240
Young Master.

677
36:07.280 --> 36:08.080
Young Master.

678
36:10.840 --> 36:11.640
Young Master.

679
36:14.640 --> 36:15.230
Murder!

680
36:15.320 --> 36:16.240
Murder!

681
36:27.050 --> 36:27.900
Yuanfan,

682
36:28.710 --> 36:29.110
my boy.

683
36:30.710 --> 36:31.780
I am Zhang Yinhua.

684
36:32.470 --> 36:33.550
I am Zhang Yinhua.

685
36:34.070 --> 36:35.030
Zhang Yinhua!

686
36:36.550 --> 36:37.610
What are you doing?

687
36:37.880 --> 36:38.810
Don't come over!

688
36:39.820 --> 36:41.260
I am your father!

689
36:42.230 --> 36:43.760
And you still want to kill me

690
36:45.760 --> 36:46.690
and trap my soul?

691
36:46.960 --> 36:48.400
What nonsense are you talking about?

692
36:48.400 --> 36:50.360
Stop playing dumb with me!

693
36:53.820 --> 36:54.840
What is this?

694
37:10.760 --> 37:12.220
And what are these things?

695
37:12.290 --> 37:14.040
Tell me, what are these?

696
37:19.440 --> 37:20.000
Father,

697
37:20.760 --> 37:21.480
tell me.

698
37:26.320 --> 37:27.190
Do you love me?

699
37:30.610 --> 37:31.980
Do you love me?

700
37:35.170 --> 37:37.120
Yes, I love you...

701
37:39.440 --> 37:40.840
The entire Zhang family

702
37:42.320 --> 37:43.230
will be mine.

703
37:44.320 --> 37:45.320
Since you love me,

704
37:46.920 --> 37:47.630
Father,

705
37:52.070 --> 37:53.440
just stay here

706
37:53.980 --> 37:56.140
and bless me with wealth and glory!

707
38:14.740 --> 38:16.230
♪ The lantern waits for one ♪

708
38:16.250 --> 38:17.730
♪ Who won't return ♪

709
38:17.760 --> 38:20.730
♪ My eyes hide a sorrow beyond words ♪

710
38:20.930 --> 38:22.990
♪ I ask for too much ♪

711
38:23.020 --> 38:24.900
♪ Then blame fate ♪

712
38:25.150 --> 38:27.650
♪ One step, one trap, one fall ♪

713
38:27.670 --> 38:30.880
♪ Greed turns into a chain to trap the old love ♪

714
38:31.120 --> 38:34.400
♪ Play with fire, yet people's foolishness will never burn away ♪

715
38:34.420 --> 38:38.150
♪ Who pretends to be a saint in front of others ♪

716
38:38.170 --> 38:43.400
♪ Yet turns around and wallows in the mundane world? ♪

717
38:48.000 --> 38:54.070
♪ My greed burns away who I am ♪

718
38:54.740 --> 39:00.200
♪ My anger clouds what I hold dear ♪

719
39:01.240 --> 39:07.560
♪ My obsession keeps me from turning back ♪

720
39:07.580 --> 39:13.810
♪ I keep my heart closed ♪

721
39:21.150 --> 39:22.760
Let me go!

722
39:50.000 --> 39:51.960
You're making me clean up your mess again, huh?

723
39:51.960 --> 39:53.000
This case

724
39:53.280 --> 39:56.210
is enough for you to claim credit with Director Wang.

725
39:57.700 --> 39:59.490
You may be nosy,

726
40:00.670 --> 40:01.960
but you're always doing

727
40:01.960 --> 40:03.320
righteous things.

728
40:03.570 --> 40:04.760
Why does a person like you

729
40:04.760 --> 40:05.440
have to

730
40:05.440 --> 40:07.170
stay with a bunch of swindlers?

731
40:08.070 --> 40:10.030
You've also diligently worked on various cases

732
40:10.030 --> 40:11.560
in Yucheng, Detective Guo.

733
40:11.760 --> 40:13.280
Why does a person like you

734
40:14.150 --> 40:15.070
have to

735
40:15.400 --> 40:16.880
work for Director Wang?

736
40:17.390 --> 40:18.750
Drink tea as you please,

737
40:19.080 --> 40:20.480
but don't talk nonsense.

738
40:31.580 --> 40:34.550
[Tomb of Liu Xijiao]

739
40:34.800 --> 40:35.840
What's this?

740
40:38.950 --> 40:40.150
Didn't Xijiao leave?

741
40:44.070 --> 40:44.710
Liang,

742
40:45.440 --> 40:46.550
There's something I never knew

743
40:46.550 --> 40:47.630
how to tell you.

744
40:48.760 --> 40:49.800
At this point...

745
40:52.110 --> 40:54.040
I think I should tell you the truth.

746
40:54.230 --> 40:55.280
Because I don't want to be

747
40:55.280 --> 40:56.740
a swindler in front of you.

748
40:58.840 --> 41:01.240
Liu Xijiao wasn't let go by the Sect Master.

749
41:02.720 --> 41:04.450
The Sect Master got her killed.

750
41:04.670 --> 41:06.190
I buried her with my own hands.

751
41:06.190 --> 41:06.880
No way.

752
41:07.400 --> 41:08.630
The Sect Master wouldn't kill the innocent.

753
41:08.630 --> 41:09.960
The Sect Master wouldn't kill Liu Xijiao!

754
41:09.960 --> 41:10.590
Liang.

755
41:10.800 --> 41:12.150
I said, it's impossible!

756
41:12.150 --> 41:13.480
The Sect Master treats us gofers so well!

757
41:13.480 --> 41:14.840
Stop lying to yourself.

758
41:15.360 --> 41:17.090
We experienced the Soul-Trapping Game together.

759
41:17.090 --> 41:18.610
If we hadn't saved Li Ling,

760
41:20.190 --> 41:21.590
she would be dead as well.

761
41:24.440 --> 41:26.030
The Sect Master has drowned so many innocent girls

762
41:26.030 --> 41:27.070
in water vats

763
41:27.230 --> 41:28.110
just to continue

764
41:28.110 --> 41:29.970
his scam that has lasted 50 years.

765
41:47.960 --> 41:48.890
Eight years ago,

766
41:49.800 --> 41:52.000
the Sect Master set a trap in Jianghuai,

767
41:52.290 --> 41:54.600
ruining a family of the Wangs.

768
41:55.350 --> 41:56.080
At that time,

769
41:56.600 --> 41:59.130
only one person in the whole family survived.

770
41:59.170 --> 42:01.800
He saw the bodies of his younger brother and younger sister

771
42:01.800 --> 42:03.240
floating on the Nanxi River.

772
42:02.310 --> 42:08.890
♪ Under the old city wall, that year the rain fell gently ♪

773
42:04.360 --> 42:05.720
That only survivor

774
42:07.550 --> 42:08.480
was me.

775
42:08.960 --> 42:10.630
At that time, I only wanted to die,

776
42:09.470 --> 42:15.420
♪ You walked by with an umbrella, saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

777
42:11.280 --> 42:12.550
but I met Jin Buhuan.

778
42:13.710 --> 42:16.110
He told me the truth behind the whole thing.

779
42:16.490 --> 42:22.800
♪ Later, a blade lay hidden within a smile ♪

780
42:16.960 --> 42:17.960
Since then,

781
42:18.880 --> 42:20.760
I've only had one thought in my mind.

782
42:20.760 --> 42:22.420
As long as I can get revenge...

783
42:24.050 --> 42:31.300
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark cut deep into my heart ♪

784
42:24.420 --> 42:26.150
I'm willing to learn anything.

785
42:31.720 --> 42:37.330
♪ You know full well how weak I am ♪

786
42:32.870 --> 42:33.660
Liang,

787
42:34.710 --> 42:37.110
about what kind of person the Sect Master is

788
42:37.860 --> 42:40.050
♪ Yet you always turn around ♪

789
42:38.440 --> 42:40.250
and what kind of organization the Tianxiang Sect is,

790
42:40.070 --> 42:45.860
♪ Shielding me from harsh words and cold daggers ♪

791
42:40.870 --> 42:42.730
you have to see clearly on your own

792
42:45.960 --> 42:47.280
and think it through.

793
42:47.000 --> 42:50.460
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

794
42:50.510 --> 42:53.410
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

795
42:54.070 --> 42:57.570
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

796
42:57.600 --> 43:00.160
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

797
43:00.970 --> 43:04.510
♪ May you find your way out of the haze that is us ♪

798
43:04.540 --> 43:07.230
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

799
43:07.930 --> 43:11.320
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

800
43:11.340 --> 43:16.250
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

801
43:12.550 --> 43:13.670
I'm sorry...

802
43:14.760 --> 43:15.590
Xijiao...

803
43:16.550 --> 43:18.150
I was too stupid.

804
43:19.630 --> 43:21.440
I didn't protect you well.

805
43:22.230 --> 43:24.230
I lost you.

806
43:41.050 --> 43:41.860
Xijiao,

807
43:42.320 --> 43:43.230
trust me.

808
43:43.700 --> 43:49.470
♪ By the window, flowers withers as time passes ♪

809
43:44.380 --> 43:46.440
I will definitely avenge your death.

810
43:47.070 --> 43:48.150
Sect Master...

811
43:50.550 --> 43:56.270
♪ You lean on the door with a smile and ask how long it takes to let go ♪

812
43:51.670 --> 43:52.760
Just you wait.

813
43:55.210 --> 43:56.740
[Jiulongpo Station, Yucheng]

814
43:57.140 --> 44:04.060
♪ The blade draws near yet misses every time ♪

815
44:01.550 --> 44:03.030
Not all girls

816
44:03.590 --> 44:04.760
can get away clean

817
44:05.150 --> 44:11.380
♪ The moment you do it, all that's left is a trembling embrace ♪

818
44:05.440 --> 44:06.590
like Li Ling.

819
44:07.230 --> 44:08.440
She sold her house

820
44:08.920 --> 44:10.720
and can stay in Pangzhou for now.

821
44:10.920 --> 44:11.800
In the future,

822
44:12.240 --> 44:15.350
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

823
44:12.550 --> 44:13.950
she can also go to Nanyang

824
44:14.030 --> 44:15.070
for peace.

825
44:15.470 --> 44:17.430
Just one boat ticket to Nanyang

826
44:15.590 --> 44:18.090
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

827
44:18.650 --> 44:22.450
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

828
44:19.280 --> 44:21.480
costs enough to buy a girl from our sect.

829
44:22.030 --> 44:23.360
I've explained everything

830
44:22.690 --> 44:25.350
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

831
44:24.150 --> 44:25.610
about Liu Xijiao to Liang.

832
44:25.880 --> 44:29.100
♪ May you find your way out of the haze that is us ♪

833
44:26.510 --> 44:28.370
He'll eventually know the truth,

834
44:29.320 --> 44:31.850
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

835
44:29.400 --> 44:30.840
and he deserves to know

836
44:31.230 --> 44:32.290
what kind of person

837
44:32.680 --> 44:36.290
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

838
44:33.190 --> 44:34.720
on earth the Sect Master is.

839
44:35.320 --> 44:36.600
Did the Sect Master cause you any trouble

840
44:36.600 --> 44:40.540
♪ I'll hold back and let you go ♪

841
44:38.230 --> 44:39.560
for saving those girls?

842
44:39.800 --> 44:40.710
Not yet.

843
44:41.760 --> 44:43.690
I guess he has more ruthless tricks

844
44:44.110 --> 44:45.360
waiting for me.

845
44:46.070 --> 44:47.280
If possible,

846
44:47.670 --> 44:48.590
I'd rather

847
44:51.080 --> 44:52.370
die by your hands.

848
44:53.430 --> 44:54.160
With me here,

849
44:57.810 --> 44:59.040
you'll be fine.

850
45:09.500 --> 45:11.750
[In the next episode]

851
45:11.960 --> 45:14.220
The Fifth Batou and Shangguan Chengming

852
45:14.320 --> 45:16.140
saved Paozi from the trap.

853
45:16.160 --> 45:17.280
They were also the ones

854
45:17.280 --> 45:18.340
who broke the trap.

855
45:18.760 --> 45:21.220
Breaking the trap means breaking the rules.

856
45:22.420 --> 45:24.480
Now you're talking to me about rules?

857
45:24.590 --> 45:25.510
So what?

858
45:25.510 --> 45:26.150
Either

859
45:26.150 --> 45:27.440
you kill Jiang Feiyan,

860
45:27.880 --> 45:28.630
or

861
45:29.070 --> 45:30.200
I'll kill both of you

862
45:31.440 --> 45:32.230
today.

863
45:32.230 --> 45:34.290
The Tianxiang Sect has another rule.

864
45:34.330 --> 45:36.370
We run scams for money but don't kill.

865
45:36.370 --> 45:37.960
According to the rules you mentioned,

866
45:37.960 --> 45:40.150
shouldn't everyone be killed today?
